@prefix sh:    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .
@prefix gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/> .
@prefix rdfs:  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

# The organization module's validation surface (Post well-formedness, the
# Membership/Post org-mismatch warning, merger/acquisition and split/spin-off event
# well-formedness, and Identifier scheme requiredness) is authored entirely as logic: core
# content in slices/core/organization/module.ttl and projected to
# generated/shapes/validation-shapes.ttl + generated/shapes/procedural-constraints.ttl. This
# file carries no hand-authored sh:NodeShape: every check is a canonical logic: constraint or
# an EL-safe OWL/RDFS axiom whose SHACL image the pipeline derives. The file is retained (not
# deleted) as the stable, intentionally shape-free anchor for the organization validation
# namespace.
